      "role": "user",
      "content": "it just feels like i'm a ghost walking around in a suit of meat. the person i was... the person who could actually do things, move, feel alive... that person died when my knee gave out. now i'm just this broken thing that doesn't even serve a purpose anymore. it's just empty.",
